sequenceDiagram
    participant Staff as Recruiter
    participant API as Express API
    participant Score as scoring.js
    participant Guest as Anonymous User
    participant DB as MongoDB

    Note over Staff,DB: 1. Assessment banao + public link
    Staff->>API: Build assessment (drag-drop, bank, correct answers)
    Staff->>API: POST /assessments/:id/public-link
    API->>DB: generate publicId, isPublic=true
    API-->>Staff: link /t/aBc123

    Note over Guest,DB: 2. Anonymous test (no login)
    Guest->>API: GET /public/assessments/aBc123
    API->>API: stripAnswerKey()
    API-->>Guest: Test (answers hidden)
    Note over Guest: Timer chalta ⏱️ auto-submit
    Guest->>API: POST submit {name, answers}
    API->>DB: find-or-create guest user
    API->>Score: scoreResponse()
    Score-->>API: score, percentage, passed
    API->>DB: save Response
    API-->>Guest: Result (pass/fail)

    Note over Staff,DB: 3. Staff Reports mein dikhta hai
    Staff->>API: GET /responses
    API-->>Staff: Guest ka result (score, ✓/✗)
